<title>RUSSIA: Russia's VSM sets 19.06 pct coupon rate.</title>
<headline>Russia's VSM sets 19.06 pct coupon rate.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's RAO Vysokoskorostnye Magistrali (VSM, or High-Speed Railways) set a 19.06 percent rate for the fourth coupon of the second issue of its bonds, a central bank official said on Friday.</p>
<p>				 4th coupon     3d coupon</p>
<p>    Coupon rate(rbls)    4,804 rbls     9,097 rbls</p>
<p>    Coupon rate (pct)    19.06	    36.49</p>
<p>    Coupon date	    Oct 3, 1997    July 3, 1997</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
